## 3. Plan artifact model (target shape)

Conceptual fields (final schema at implement time):

```text
Plan {
  id, title, goal, status: draft|approved|running|completed|failed|cancelled
  createdAt, updatedAt, workspaceRoot, chatTabId?
  assumptions[], risks[]
  steps: [{
    id, content, status: pending|in_progress|completed|cancelled|failed|skipped
    optional?, blockedByStepIds[]
    hints: { files[], symbols[], commands[] }
    acceptance?: string   // e.g. "npm test passes", "F12 works on fixture"
  }]
  execution?: { startedAt, finishedAt, lastError? }
}
```

UI:
- [ ] Plan panel / card richer than today’s `AgentPlanCard` (editable in draft; read-only statuses while running unless “revise”)
- [ ] Diff of plan revisions (v1 → v2) optional but valuable

