## 5. Cursor weaknesses → Vigil improvements (beat Cursor)

These are intentional product differentiators — keep them in scope:

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Clarity & control
- [ ] **True editability** of steps before execute (not “ask the model to rewrite the whole plan” only)
- [ ] **Reorder by drag** (or clear up/down) without regenerating everything  
- [ ] **Optional / must** step flags so the agent doesn’t treat every bullet as sacred  
- [ ] **Acceptance checks** per step (tests, search query, manual note) — Cursor often leaves this vague  

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Continuity
- [ ] Plans **persist** and are resumable after crash / close / Stop  
- [ ] Mid-run Stop doesn’t orphan the plan  
- [ ] “Continue plan” restores context from plan + compact chat memory + deep index  

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Grounding in large repos (Vigil advantage)
- [ ] Plan generation should **cite** deep index / defs / refs / project map (links or paths)  
- [ ] Steps can attach `hints.files` / `hints.symbols` from `search_codebase` / `find_definition`  
- [ ] Prefer `parallel_investigate` during Plan mode for cheap grounding before proposing steps  

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Parallel & ops awareness
- [ ] Plan can mark steps as `parallelizable` → later map to `delegate_tasks` / worktrees  
- [ ] Explicit ops steps: test gate, `push_and_check_ci`, draft PR — first-class, not afterthoughts  
- [ ] Dangerous steps visually flagged (push, delete, migrate)  

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Honesty & anti-drift
- [ ] Agent must not mark a step completed without evidence (file change, test result, or explicit N/A reason)  
- [ ] If execution drifts from plan, require **plan amendment** (user-visible) instead of silent divergence  
- [ ] Don’t start coding while still answering “what should we do?” in Plan mode  

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Language & accessibility
- [ ] Plan UI and steps follow user’s language (Arabic/English) like the rest of Vigil  
- [ ] Compact, readable steps — avoid huge walls of text; details expandable  

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Privacy / cloud boundary
- [ ] Plan **text/steps** may live in Firestore (user account); **never** attach private repo file contents to the cloud plan
- [ ] Desktop Execute uses local workspace only 

