> **عربي:** علاقتها باللي موجود في Vigil دلوقتي

## 6. Interaction with existing systems

| Existing | Role after Plan Mode ships |
|----------|----------------------------|
| `manage_plan` | Becomes the **execution updater** for an approved Plan (or merges into it) — not a substitute for draft/approve |
| `AgentPlanCard` | Evolve into / feed **Plan Panel** (draft editable + running statuses) |
| Deep index / LSP-lite tools | Allowed in Plan mode (read-only investigation) |
| `delegate_tasks` | Only after Execute, and only for steps marked parallelizable |
| `00-الخطة-العامة-والأولويات.mdc` | Meta roadmap for building Vigil — separate from in-app user plans |
| Auto-run / approvals | Still apply during Execute; Plan mode itself is the first gate |

